SUMMARY:Upper Hypertrophy + Shoulders / Upper Back
DESCRIPTION:Overview:\nMacros: 3550 kcal\, 175 g protein\, 525 g carbs\, 9
 5 g fat\nMacro timing: 30-60 g carbs 60-120 min before running\, then 25-
 35 g protein plus carbs after.\nCategory: gym\nRun volume: 4 km\n\n\nWarm
 -Up:\n- 5 min easy cardio\, shoulder prep\, light rows\, and thoracic mob
 ility.\n\n\nMain Work:\n- Progression: double progression\; add reps befo
 re load and keep the whole session capped around RPE 8.\n- Chest-supporte
 d row\, cable row\, Pendlay row\, or barbell row: 4 x 8-12 at RPE 8 paire
 d with dumbbell or machine shoulder press 3 x 8-10 at RPE 8.\n- Lat pull-
 down or pull-ups: 3 x 8-12 at RPE 8 paired with incline dumbbell press 2-
 3 x 8-12 at RPE 8.\n- Shoulder and upper back finisher: lateral raises 3 
 x 15-20\, rear delt fly or reverse pec-deck 3 x 15-20\, face pulls 2 x 12
 -15\, and dumbbell rotator cuff work.\n- Easy run RPE 3-4: 3-4 km convers
 ational only if legs feel normal\; otherwise walk 20-30 min.\n\n\nRun:\n-
  Planned running volume: 4 km.\n\n\nFueling:\n- Hit daily macros\, keep p
 rotein near target\, and place carbohydrates before and after training.\n
 \n\nRecovery:\n- Sleep window stays 22:00-06:00\; add mobility if joints 
 feel stiff.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
