 , joint prep\, and 2-3 gradual ramp sets before loading.\n\n\nMain Work:\
 n- Easy run RPE 3-4: 9 km conversational\; shorten to 6 km if sleep or kn
 ees are poor.\n\n\nOptional:\n- 4 x 20 sec relaxed strides at RPE 6 only 
 if the week felt easy.\n\n\nRun:\n- Planned running volume: 7 km.\n\n\nFu
 eling:\n- carbs before and after\; keep this aerobic\, not competitive.\n
 \n\nRecovery:\n- long mobility reset for calves\, quads\, hips\, and feet
 .
