 ck squat or goblet squat: top set 1 x 6-8 at RPE 8\, then 2 back-off sets
  x 8-10 at RPE 7-8.\n- Romanian deadlift: 3 x 6-8 at RPE 7-8 with control
 led eccentrics.\n- Leg extension: 3 x 12-15 at RPE 8 paired with front-fo
 ot elevated split squat 2-3 x 8-10 per leg at RPE 7.\n- Core finisher: se
 ated calf raise plus tibialis raises 4 x 12-20 each at RPE 7\, then side 
