 , joint prep\, and 2-3 gradual ramp sets before loading.\n\n\nMain Work:\
 n- Easy run RPE 3-4: 10 km at conversational effort\; keep the final 2 km
  controlled\, not fast.\n\n\nRun:\n- Planned running volume: 8 km.\n\n\nF
 ueling:\n- eat carbs the night before and before the run\; add electrolyt
 es if warm.\n\n\nRecovery:\n- calves\, quads\, hip flexors\, and gentle k
 nee-friendly range work.\n- protein plus a large carb meal within 2 hours
 .
